{"id":"vod_sn_36665","vodId":"36665","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"老虎和兔子","name_cn":"老虎和兔子","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3119c955f14b63566269945d9ad1d346.jpg"},"summary":"人类文明高度发达的未来城市休特尔比尔特，生活着一群拥有特殊能力的人群，他们被人称作“Next”。在这个物欲横流、罪行多发的堕落年代，Next们凭借自己卓越的能力扮演起正义战士的角色，当然现实生活中他们必须养家糊口，于是帅气拉风的铠甲上印满了赞助商的商标。为这一切推波助澜 的，是一档名为HeroTV Live的真人秀节目，制片方跟踪直播每一位英雄的正义行动，并根据他们的表现排名，定期评选出“King of Hero”。人气滑落的Wild Tiger镝木·T·虎彻（平田广明 配音）是一个为了抓捕罪犯不惜破坏公物的鲁莽战士，正值此时，他被安排和人气飙升的巴纳比·布鲁克斯·Jr.（森田成一 配音）组队。　　两个性格完全不同的正义战士，在这个商业气息极浓的社会里将擦出怎样的火花？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qZwWk5e8C61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yt4EqjYpDF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0ihQzeGaXg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8mHGAAPAXW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wKJgGcLTYp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gu9HFTtbRk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nM5rPDRuvs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HaqErDSjS01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MeNh6EMDhX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vWga97vvve1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yNFBsrkXNh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M1JfLds6Hk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GQBD3z7fy51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/20